@title Checkout reliability
# Checkout reliability

Three releases landed inside four weeks. The error rate fell after each fix, and the second incident came right after the v2.4 deploy.

data err = week,errors,p99; W1,42,310; W2,38,305; W3,61,420; W4,57,390; W5,33,300; W6,29,288; W7,31,292; W8,24,270; W9,22,262; W10,19,255; W11,18,251; W12,17,248

chart line err y=errors title="Checkout errors per day" mark="W3 deploy v2.4" mark="W4 rollback" mark="W5 retry fix"
